# A Thief in Norg!?'s edges. Section 1 off, one operand each: bob (a level 49 Samurai, Yomi Okuri completed): default
# 71, and 71 again at AF3_QUEST_LEVEL 49.4 (the setting compared as a number: 49 < 49.4); carl (a level 50 Warrior, completed): 71; dan (a level 50 Samurai, Yomi Okuri accepted at Prog 2, no feather): its
# 147 twice (no tie with a 158). Main (a level 50 Samurai, Yomi Okuri completed, no mustZone): Timer now + 1: 157; Timer
# = now: 158 (options 0 and 2: not begun); the mustZone alone (a GM): 157. Available, the thread traded with the helm held (the accepted trade; the status the only change): nothing.
# Begun. Prog 0 (a GM): 159; Prog 4: 159; Prog 5: 166 finished with a full inventory: giveItem false, Prog stays 5; 166:
# the charm, Prog 6; 166 again at Prog 5 (a GM) with the charm held (rare): giveItem false, Prog 5 (Prog 6 without the
# charm: ed below). Prog 7: 160; Prog 9 (a GM), no mustZone, Wait now + 1: 163; Wait = now and the mustZone alone (a
# GM): 163; Wait = now: 164 finished with a full
# inventory: complete false: still accepted. Prog 10: nil (default 71). Jaucribaix's trade: the thread without the helm:
# nil; the helm and the thread with the charm: nil; two threads: nil. Sanosuke: Prog 0: nil (default 303), Prog 5: 306; Phoochuchu: Prog 1: nil (default 300), Prog 5: 302;
# the door _6i8: Prog 2 and Prog 4: nil (no script, no default: the trigger returns -1, no event). Waughroon Shrine's
# zone-in at Prog 3 and 5: no event. ed (a level 50 Samurai, accepted at Prog 6 with no charm): 168 finished with a full
# inventory: nothing; 168: the charm, Prog stays 6.
